# Quick Add stays open when another program changes the file, and Enter adds to the reloaded INBOX.
file <<END
Work:
	- Write report
INBOX:
	- Fix the shelf
END
keys q
type Fix sink
see Quick Add → INBOX
outside <<END
Garden:
	- Rake leaves
Work:
	- Write report
INBOX:
	- Fix the shelf
END
see Garden:
keys <Enter>
see - Fix sink
quit
saved <<END
Garden:
	- Rake leaves
Work:
	- Write report
INBOX:
	- Fix the shelf
	- Fix sink
END
